ual"}],"detections":[{"id":"M-2_232-693","start":232,"end":693,"length":462,"signature":"level_shift","title":"Level shift: sustained displacement from baseline","severity":"medium","action":"Place commanding on hold and notify the subsystem engineer. Verify last command sequence against expected telemetry response.","z_peak":8.99,"w_mean":-0.1961,"w_std":0.7331,"b_mean":-0.0847,"b_std":0.8936,"cmds":["cmd_4","cmd_10","cmd_11","cmd_18","cmd_19","cmd_26","cmd_32","cmd_52"],"brief":{"file":"results/briefs/M-2_232-693.md","happened":"The M-2 channel on MSL showed a medium severity anomaly from sample 232 to 693 (462 samples of 2277). The detector signature was \"level_shift\" with a mean of -0.1961, standard deviation of 0.7331, minimum of -1.0772, and maximum of 0.8962.","matters":"This deviation from baseline indicates a potential issue with the spacecraft's subsystem, which could affect overall system performance if not addressed.","next":"Place commanding on hold, notify the subsystem engineer, and verify the last command sequence against the expected telemetry response.","markdown":"# M-2 - Level shift: sustained displacement from baseline\n\n- **Spacecraft**: MSL\n- **Window**: samples 232-693 of 2277\n- **Signature**: `level_shift` - **Severity**: medium\n- **Written by**: IBM Granite (`granite4:3b`) running locally via Ollama\n\nWHAT HAPPENED: The M-2 channel on MSL showed a medium severity anomaly from sample 232 to 693 (462 samples of 2277). The detector signature was \"level_shift\" with a mean of -0.1961, standard deviation of 0.7331, minimum of -1.0772, and maximum of 0.8962.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS: This deviation from baseline indicates a potential issue with the spacecraft's subsystem, which could affect overall system performance if not addressed.\n\nWHAT TO DO NEXT: Place commanding on hold, notify the subsystem engineer, and verify the last command sequence against the expected telemetry response.\n"},"hit":false},{"id":"M-2_1150-2276","start":1150,"end":2