XT: 1. Immediately notify the Flight Director and the subsystem engineer. 2. Do not issue any further commands to the affected subsystem until the root cause is identified. 3. Review the telemetry data for cmd_4, cmd_10, cmd_11, cmd_18, cmd_19, cmd_26, cmd_32, and cmd_40 during the flagged window for any anomalies.\n"},"hit":true}],"baseline":[{"start":232,"end":378},{"start":488,"end":693},{"start":1150,"end":1210},{"start":1274,"end":2276}]}